Test data
---------

`tests/fixtures/networks/` contains sampled datasets and network definitions
for five Bayesian networks from the public Bayesian Network Repository (asia,
cancer, child, insurance, alarm). They are included so the test suite runs
without external downloads, and are used for testing only -- no causalbase code
depends on them at run time, and they are excluded from the distributed package
(the wheel packages only `src/causalbase`).

Bayesian Network Repository: https://www.bnlearn.com/bnrepository/
